    <briefdescription>
<para>TOML字符串值类 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>表示TOML中的字符串，支持四种引号类型：<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Basic：双引号字符串 &quot;string&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Literal：单引号字符串 &apos;string&apos;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>MultiBasic：多行双引号字符串 &quot;&quot;&quot;string&quot;&quot;&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>MultiLiteral：多行单引号字符串 &apos;&apos;&apos;string&apos;&apos;&apos; </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
